# Testing (MUST)

- Every acceptance criterion (`US-xx` in `docs/product/PRD.md`) maps to at least one test; name tests after the behaviour.
- Query by role and label (`getByRole('button', { name: 'Save' })`), not CSS classes.
- Deterministic: mock network (MSW), fake timers, seeded data, no order dependence.
- Cover unhappy paths: validation, network failure, empty, offline, permission denied, session expiry, double submit.
- Authorization tests for every resource endpoint.
- Bug fix = failing test first. Never delete or weaken a test to make it pass.
- Include automated accessibility checks (axe) in component/e2e tests for new screens.

Full standard: @.agents/skills/product-standards/references/testing.md
